        {
          "description": "The rows a button's command answered, a figure each (KentOS's stat card): `title`'s column names it (none: the\nfirst column), `value`'s is its figure (none: the second), `unit`'s and `note`'s beside and under it; the cards\nside by side as the panel's width allows. A row with a `uid` is an object.",
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string"
